
# game/script.rpy:72
translate chinese start_2b370c74:

    # "Did you know that our Sun is a very unusual star?"
     "你知道吗？我们的太阳是一颗非常不寻常的恒星。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Did you know that our Sun is a very unusual star?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:74
translate chinese start_463eb867:

    # "To start with, it’s a yellow dwarf."
     "首先嘛，它是一颗黄矮星。{size=-8}{color=#999999} To start with, it’s a yellow dwarf.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:75
translate chinese start_f4fe890b:

    # extend " Those constitute for just 7-10%% of all stars in the universe."
    extend "而这类恒星在宇宙所有恒星中只占7-10%%。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Those constitute for just 7-10%% of all stars in the universe.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate chinese start_c9aa57f0:

    # extend " \nIt's an outlier even among those."
    extend "\n就算在黄矮星里，它也算个异类。{size=-8}{color=#999999} \nIt's an outlier even among those.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate chinese start_9d40a536:

    # "Most yellow dwarves are primarily covered with dark spots."
     "大多数黄矮星的表面都布满黑子。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Most yellow dwarves are primarily covered with dark spots.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:78
translate chinese start_447850d4:

    # extend " The Sun isn’t."
    extend "太阳却不是。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The Sun isn’t.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:79
translate chinese start_3c22fee5:

    # "The majority of its surface is bright – in fact, it has three times the number of light spots than it does dark spots."
     "它的表面大部分是明亮的——事实上，它的光斑数量是黑子的三倍。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The majority of its surface is bright – in fact, it has three times the number of light spots than it does dark spots.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:80
translate chinese start_7d12504d:

    # "Sure, its overall brightness index is nothing special."
     "诚然，它的整体亮度指数平平无奇。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Sure, its overall brightness index is nothing special.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate chinese start_e44aabaa:

    # extend " You could even call it underwhelming compared to other stars of its type."
    extend "甚至可以说，和同类恒星比起来，它有点拿不出手。{size=-8}{color=#999999} You could even call it underwhelming compared to other stars of its type.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:82
translate chinese start_9ea3fb72:

    # "But even so, it works harder than most to shine as bright as it can."
     "但即便如此，它仍比大多数恒星都更努力地燃烧，只为尽可能闪耀。{size=-8}{color=#999999} But even so, it works harder than most to shine as bright as it can.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate chinese start_38aafcbc:

    # extend " And I find that really cute."
    extend "而我觉得，这特别可爱。{size=-8}{color=#999999} And I find that really cute.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate chinese start_d6911c56:

    # "I don’t remember where I read about this."
     "我不记得自己是从哪儿读到的这些了。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I don’t remember where I read about this.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:92
translate chinese start_ce4b1e27:

    # extend " Must have been some newspaper from years ago."
    extend "应该是很多年前某份报纸上的东西吧。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Must have been some newspaper from years ago.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:93
translate chinese start_61b68228:

    # "But that small piece of trivia still pops in my mind whenever I look up at the morning sky."
     "可每当抬头望向清晨的天空，那点小小的冷知识总会浮现在我脑海里。{size=-8}{color=#999999} But that small piece of trivia still pops in my mind whenever I look up at the morning sky.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:94
translate chinese start_362016be:

    # "It’s not much of a view, to be honest."
     "说实话，这算不上什么风景。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It’s not much of a view, to be honest.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate chinese start_e19da8bc:

    # extend " Not much of a sky, not much of a sun."
    extend "算不上天空，也算不上太阳。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Not much of a sky, not much of a sun.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:96
translate chinese start_a69c39d1:

    # extend " I guess that’s the kind of region it is."
    extend "大概，我们这地方就是这样吧。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I guess that’s the kind of region it is.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate chinese start_04d817f8:

    # "Some people say the sun is just lazing around in our parts, what with the constant snow."
     "有人说，太阳在我们这一带就是在偷懒，毕竟这里老是下雪。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Some people say the sun is just lazing around in our parts, what with the constant snow.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:98
translate chinese start_fa761844:

    # "But people that go around saying that, well..."
     "不过，张口闭口说这种话的人啊……{size=-8}{color=#999999} But people that go around saying that, well...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:99
translate chinese start_996e471b:

    # extend " \nThey clearly haven’t read that newspaper."
    extend "\n他们显然没读过那份报纸。{size=-8}{color=#999999} \nThey clearly haven’t read that newspaper.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:108
translate chinese start_a064a290:

    # "The more I thought about things like that and the more I learned, the more I realised how incredible everything is."
     "这类事情想得越多、学得越多，我就越发觉得，万事万物都不可思议。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The more I thought about things like that and the more I learned, the more I realised how incredible everything is.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate chinese start_bd6a15bc:

    # "I'm not just saying that to mean “amazing”."
     "我这么说，可不只是“好厉害”那种意思。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I'm not just saying that to mean “amazing”.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:110
translate chinese start_4f18e5d7:

    # extend " I mean “improbable”."
    extend "我说的是“不太可能”。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I mean “improbable”.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate chinese start_54e10e89:

    # "You can't deny the world is full of great coincidences."
     "不可否认，这个世界充满了绝妙的巧合。{size=-8}{color=#999999} You can't deny the world is full of great coincidences.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate chinese start_f63310dd:

    # extend " It's to the point where I've begun to ask myself how much of it we can attribute to pure chance."
    extend "巧合多到我开始自问：这一切里，究竟有多少能归功于纯粹的偶然。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It's to the point where I've begun to ask myself how much of it we can attribute to pure chance.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:113
translate chinese start_cd312a8a:

    # "The universe was so kind as to give us both a star and a planet with the perfect conditions for sentient life."
     "宇宙是如此仁慈，既给了我们一颗恒星，又给了我们一颗具备智慧生命完美条件的行星。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The universe was so kind as to give us both a star and a planet with the perfect conditions for sentient life.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:114
translate chinese start_3e5faf55:

    # "Just the slightest fluctuation in the composition of our atmosphere, the size of the globe, or the distance between Earth and the Sun – and none of us, none of the beauty surrounding us, would exist."
     "只要大气成分、地球体积、抑或日地距离有丝毫偏差——我们、连同环绕着我们的这一切美景，都将不复存在。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Just the slightest fluctuation in the composition of our atmosphere, the size of the globe, or the distance between Earth and the Sun – and none of us, none of the beauty surrounding us, would exist.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:115
translate chinese start_5c45ea35:

    # "Some would call it a miracle."
     "有人会称之为奇迹。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Some would call it a miracle.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate chinese start_f664b285:

    # extend " And of course, that's a lovely way to put it..."
    extend "当然啦，这说法很动听……{size=-8}{color=#999999} And of course, that's a lovely way to put it...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate chinese start_1ad929b4:

    # extend " But isn't that giving the world we're living in too little credit?"
    extend "可这是不是太小看我们身处的这个世界了？{size=-8}{color=#999999} But isn't that giving the world we're living in too little credit?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate chinese start_7d0f6a58:

    # "Ah, but it’s not that I subscribe to the anthropic principle or anything!"
     "啊，不过我可不是在鼓吹什么人择原理！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Ah, but it’s not that I subscribe to the anthropic principle or anything!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate chinese start_7d05f8fa:

    # "I'm not so arrogant as to believe the universe exists just for our sake."
     "我还没自大到认为宇宙是为了我们才存在的地步。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I'm not so arrogant as to believe the universe exists just for our sake.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:129
translate chinese start_de622ee1:

    # extend " Or rather, I'm not so sure it exists solely to be observed."
    extend "或者说，我也不确定它是否只是为了被观察而存在。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Or rather, I'm not so sure it exists solely to be observed.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate chinese start_a0a5e7e0:

    # "When a baby is born, it's not preoccupied with how it is perceived."
     "婴儿刚出生时，并不会在意别人怎么看自己。{size=-8}{color=#999999} When a baby is born, it's not preoccupied with how it is perceived.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:131
translate chinese start_526fb5ae:

    # extend " That conscious need emerges later, as the child develops self-awareness."
    extend "那种有意识的渴望，是随着孩子萌生自我意识才出现的。{size=-8}{color=#999999} That conscious need emerges later, as the child develops self-awareness.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:132
translate chinese start_4d81d390:

    # "Until that point, its curiosity is aimed at its surroundings."
     "在那之前，它的好奇心全都指向周遭的世界。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Until that point, its curiosity is aimed at its surroundings.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:133
translate chinese start_f0bda892:

    # extend " So if anything, it's the opposite of what the anthropic principle entails."
    extend "所以说，这恰恰与人择原理的推论相反。{size=-8}{color=#999999} So if anything, it's the opposite of what the anthropic principle entails.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:134
translate chinese start_d2a60c5c:

    # "We're social creatures, so the need to be observed makes sense for our survival."
     "我们是社会性生物，“被关注”的需求关乎我们的生存，说得通。{size=-8}{color=#999999} We're social creatures, so the need to be observed makes sense for our survival.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate chinese start_97744645:

    # extend " But to say the universe itself shares that priority..."
    extend "但要说宇宙本身也把这种需求当回事……{size=-8}{color=#999999} But to say the universe itself shares that priority...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:136
translate chinese start_5611d603:

    # extend " It just doesn't make sense to me."
    extend "我怎么都想不通。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It just doesn't make sense to me.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate chinese start_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
     "……"

# game/script.rpy:146
translate chinese start_8a2dc954:

    # extend "\nAlthough, you can also think about it this way."
    extend "\n不过嘛，也可以换个角度想。{size=-8}{color=#999999} \nAlthough, you can also think about it this way.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate chinese start_0f13e903:

    # "A child is curious about the world because it perceives the world as external."
     "孩子对世界好奇，是因为在孩子眼里，世界是身外之物。{size=-8}{color=#999999} A child is curious about the world because it perceives the world as external.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate chinese start_796416ff:

    # extend " But what if the child {i}is{/i} the world?"
    extend "可如果孩子{i}就是{/i}世界本身呢？{size=-8}{color=#999999} But what if the child {i}is{/i} the world?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:149
translate chinese start_49cf68d4:

    # extend " What if all that it could ever observe existed within itself?"
    extend "如果它所能观察到的一切，都存在于它自身之内呢？{size=-8}{color=#999999} What if all that it could ever observe existed within itself?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate chinese start_0b00e471:

    # "What can the all-encompassing universe be curious about?"
     "无所不包的宇宙，还能对什么感到好奇？{size=-8}{color=#999999} What can the all-encompassing universe be curious about?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:151
translate chinese start_44134584:

    # extend " There’s nothing but itself, so nothing but itself!"
    extend "除了它自己什么都没有，所以好奇的也只有它自己！{size=-8}{color=#999999} There’s nothing but itself, so nothing but itself!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:152
translate chinese start_96d76f07:

    # "There’s nothing else to care about in the whole wide world!"
     "整个世界里，根本没有别的可操心的事！{size=-8}{color=#999999} There’s nothing else to care about in the whole wide world!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate chinese start_fa127ab0:

    # extend " It is the world!"
    extend "因为它就是世界啊！{size=-8}{color=#999999} It is the world!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:154
translate chinese start_b61bcdc3:

    # extend " Duh!"
    extend "这不是明摆着嘛！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Duh!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate chinese start_0abd53b0:

    # "Ah, wait, now this makes perfect sense."
     "啊，等等，这么说一切都说得通了。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Ah, wait, now this makes perfect sense.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate chinese start_551703c4:

    # extend " If I put it like that..."
    extend "要这么讲的话……{size=-8}{color=#999999} If I put it like that...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate chinese start_11c3dbf5:

    # extend " I guess the universe has no choice but to be self-centered."
    extend "宇宙大概也别无选择，只能以自我为中心了。{size=-8}{color=#999999} I guess the universe has no choice but to be self-centered.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:166
translate chinese start_487dc364:

    # "Even if this wasn’t the case when it was born..."
     "就算它诞生之初并非如此……{size=-8}{color=#999999} Even if this wasn’t the case when it was born...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:167
translate chinese start_5b403766:

    # extend " What if the universe developed a desire to be perceived by others as it matured?"
    extend "随着宇宙渐渐“长大”，它会不会也萌生了渴望被他人看见的念头？{size=-8}{color=#999999} What if the universe developed a desire to be perceived by others as it matured?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:168
translate chinese start_f3ec063f:

    # extend " The same way that a child would."
    extend "就像小孩子那样。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The same way that a child would.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:169
translate chinese start_e3672880:

    # "And what do we do when we want others to perceive us a certain way?"
     "那么，当我们渴望以某种姿态被他人看见时，我们会怎么做？{size=-8}{color=#999999} And what do we do when we want others to perceive us a certain way?{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:170
translate chinese start_fb54e549:

    # extend " We try to mold ourselves accordingly."
    extend "我们会努力把自己塑造成那个样子。{size=-8}{color=#999999} We try to mold ourselves accordingly.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:171
translate chinese start_0bff4179:

    # "Ah!"
     "啊！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Ah!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:172
translate chinese start_8e4403d1:

    # extend " I think I get it now!"
    extend "我想我懂了！{size=-8}{color=#999999} I think I get it now!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate chinese start_5c16fd9e:

    # "The universe gradually felt the desire to be seen."
     "宇宙渐渐萌生了渴望被看见的念头。{size=-8}{color=#999999} The universe gradually felt the desire to be seen.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate chinese start_ca4bec69:

    # extend " It wanted to be admired, loved and observed, because there’s nothing more a world can do but to observe itself."
    extend "它渴望被欣赏、被爱、被凝视——因为一个世界除了凝视自己，也再无事可做。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It wanted to be admired, loved and observed, because there’s nothing more a world can do but to observe itself.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:175
translate chinese start_1d445be1:

    # "It’s the best and only pastime there is, as far as the world is concerned."
     "对世界而言，这是它最好、也是唯一的消遣。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It’s the best and only pastime there is, as far as the world is concerned.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:176
translate chinese start_a4bba089:

    # extend " And if observation is good, more observation is even better!"
    extend "既然观察这么美好，那观察得越多自然越好！{size=-8}{color=#999999} And if observation is good, more observation is even better!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:177
translate chinese start_2cc38dd9:

    # "Of course, an endless universe can observe itself endlessly."
     "当然，无穷的宇宙可以无穷地自我观察。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Of course, an endless universe can observe itself endlessly.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:178
translate chinese start_7bb963bb:

    # extend " You can say that its observation value equals infinity."
    extend "可以说，它的“观察值”等于无穷大。{size=-8}{color=#999999} You can say that its observation value equals infinity.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:179
translate chinese start_1e5eb113:

    # "That value may seem absolute, but it isn’t really, not in mathematics."
     "这个值看似绝对，其实不然——在数学上并非如此。{size=-8}{color=#999999} That value may seem absolute, but it isn’t really, not in mathematics.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:180
translate chinese start_73988101:

    # extend " “Infinity plus one” exists."
    extend "“无穷大加一”是存在的。{size=-8}{color=#999999} “Infinity plus one” exists.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:181
translate chinese start_56fdc8de:

    # "It’s a value that the universe could never reach as a singular, albeit infinite observer."
     "凭它一个再无穷无尽的观察者，也永远够不到这个值。{size=-8}{color=#999999} It’s a value that the universe could never reach as a singular, albeit infinite observer.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:182
translate chinese start_2dcb8741:

    # "So it had to create new, finite observers to add to its infinity - it needed to create sentient life."
     "于是它必须创造新的、有限的观察者，来为它的无穷添上一笔——它需要创造有意识的生命。{size=-8}{color=#999999} So it had to create new, finite observers to add to its infinity - it needed to create sentient life.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:183
translate chinese start_f4ba2dd9:

    # extend " Sentient life is the plus one!"
    extend "智慧生命，就是那个“加一”！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Sentient life is the plus one!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:184
translate chinese start_b1edf035:

    # "When I put it like that, it sounds like all of us are extras at a party..."
     "这么一说，倒显得我们全是派对上的群演……{size=-8}{color=#999999} When I put it like that, it sounds like all of us are extras at a party...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:185
translate chinese start_e7e0f1c3:

    # extend " Now isn't that fun!"
    extend "多有趣呀，不是吗！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Now isn't that fun!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:192
translate chinese start_064dcf7d:

    # "This vast mighty universe changed itself so meticulously to make new observers possible, it fine-tuned all of its systems so precisely..."
     "这浩瀚威严的宇宙，为了孕育新的观察者，如此细致地改变着自己，把它的一切系统都调校得如此精准……{size=-8}{color=#999999} This vast mighty universe changed itself so meticulously to make new observers possible, it fine-tuned all of its systems so precisely...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:193
translate chinese start_da3b7298:

    # extend " just to have us here."
    extend "就为了让我们存在于世。{size=-8}{color=#999999} just to have us here.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:194
translate chinese start_b79c8faa:

    # "It worked so hard just to share its one joy with us - us, worthless insects...!"
     "它如此辛苦，只为与我们分享它唯一的喜悦——与我们这些一文不值的虫豸……！{size=-8}{color=#999999} It worked so hard just to share its one joy with us - us, worthless insects...!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:195
translate chinese start_ac9cb1d4:

    # "Oh no..."
     "不好……{size=-8}{color=#999999} Oh no...{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:196
translate chinese start_653f65fc:

    # extend " Oh no, this can’t be...!"
    extend "不好、不会吧……！{size=-8}{color=#999999} Oh no, this can’t be...!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:197
translate chinese start_bed1fd0d:

    # extend " That’s cute!"
    extend "这也太可爱了！{size=-8}{color=#999999} That’s cute!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:198
translate chinese start_7de510d0:

    # extend " That’s really cute!"
    extend "真的太可爱了！{size=-8}{color=#999999} That’s really cute!{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:199
translate chinese start_f841b73a:

    # "Ah, I should’ve expected this."
     "唉，我早该料到的。{size=-8}{color=#999999} Ah, I should’ve expected this.{/color}{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:200
